2026-10-16,,Career Orientation Internship (m/f/d) Commercial Area,T-Mobile,"Fürth, BY, Germany",Fürth,south,Fürth (Bay) Hbf,3.08,12.43,S1/RE,indeed,"Job ID: 321524

Career Orientation Internship (m/f/d) Commercial Area

Fuerth

  

### **Your Task**

Are you interested in commercial topics, but are still unsure how you want to start your career? Then you've come to the right place! We offer you the opportunity to take a look behind the scenes of one of Europe's largest telecommunications companies — and help you find out which job profile suits you best.
  
  
This is what you can expect after your application:
  

* Online check with a focus on your interests and values: You will then automatically receive your personal evaluation — as valuable support for your career orientation.
* Orientation call: Together we will discuss your results and find the internship area that suits you best. In doing so, we deliberately focus on one area of application so that you can dive as deep as possible.

Important: A virtual introductory meeting will only take place if your documents and results match our offer well.
  
  
This is what you can expect:

* An internship buddy who accompanies you throughout the internship, shows you everyday life and is always there to answer your questions
* Exciting insights into commercial training/a dual commercial degree program as well as everyday working life
* An individual process that is based on your interests
* Personal tips for your further orientation and application phase
* Our internship app with interactive content and learning opportunities

### **Your Profile**

We focus on you! Your internship is your chance to try out new things, ask questions and find out what you enjoy — without any previous knowledge. We let you take a look behind the scenes, give you exciting insights and are by your side as you discover your strengths.
  
  
To take a look behind the scenes with us, you should bring the following:

* You are currently attending school and are aiming for a secondary school leaving certificate, secondary school diploma, high school diploma or a comparable school leaving certificate
* Are you interested in commercial topics — or simply want to try out whether this area suits you
* You enjoy working in a team and are open to learning new things
* You want to discover what things look like behind the scenes at Deutsche Telekom and are curious about our day-to-day work

### **Benefits**

We'll take you into the world of Magenta Telekom, show you how we work and share current projects with you.
  
The best part: Our employees, trainees or dual students take you into their everyday lives, share their experiences with you and give you real insights — you might even discover your future career in the process.
  
  
Students can complete these types of internships with us for professional orientation:
  

* Compulsory internship in general education schools (no minimum age, max. internship duration: 1-3 weeks)
* Compulsory school internship vocational school (no minimum age, max. internship duration: 3 months)
* Voluntary orientation internship during school holidays (minimum age: 15 years, max. internship duration: 4 weeks)

Important: Please indicate the desired period in your application and — if it is a mandatory internship — upload the proof directly.
  
  
Application period: To ensure that your internship with us is not only good, but really good, we need a bit of advance notice. In this way, we can work together to find the right area of employment for you and prepare everything optimally. Therefore, apply at least 6 months and at least 2 months before your desired start date. Please note: Whether the internship can actually take place always depends on whether a suitable area of employment is available in the desired period of time.
  
  
Our career orientation internship is aimed exclusively at students. Are you looking for an internship for students? Then find out more .
  
  
We look forward to receiving your application — regardless of whether you already know exactly where you want to go or are simply curious.

Job Benefits

### Work Experience

Real insights into one of the largest telecommunications companies in Europe

### Professional Development

* Internship buddy to accompany you throughout the entire internship, show you daily work and always available for your questions
* Insights into commercial training/dual study program and daily work
* Individual schedule oriented to your interests
* Personal tips for your further orientation and application phase
* Internship app with interactive content and learning opportunities
* Online check focused on your interests and values with personal evaluation for career orientation support
