* Ideally, teaching or school-based experience, as well as experience with out-of-school learning environments
* An independent and structured approach to work, strong organisational skills and enthusiasm for collaboration within a multi-site research team
* Excellent German and good English language skills

**Supplementary description**  
The position is funded by the German Research Foundation (DFG) and is therefore limited to 36 months. The project work is intended to support academic qualification. The doctoral research project will be jointly agreed upon within the scope of the overall project.

