Sprachen: Deutsch und Englisch

Surgical Sales Specialist - Gynecological Surgery 

Nürnberg / Erlangen – Ingolstadt – Landshut – Passau – Amberg

As a global leader in women's health, Hologic develops innovative technologies that improve the diagnosis and treatment of conditions affecting millions of women worldwide. Our minimally invasive surgical solutions help clinicians deliver better patient outcomes while restoring quality of life.

We are looking for a driven Sales Specialist - Surgical to lead territory growth and customer engagement across the region.

What to Expect:

Manage and develop your territory, driving revenue growth, market share, and customer expansion.

Represent Hologic's gynecological surgical portfolio, positioning innovative solutions with clinicians and healthcare decision-makers.

Build and maintain long-term relationships with gynecologists, surgeons, theatre staff, hospital administration, procurement teams, and other key stakeholders.

Deliver product demonstrations, customer training, and in-theatre support to ensure optimal product utilisation and customer satisfaction.

Identify and develop new business opportunities while strengthening existing customer partnerships and key accounts.

Monitor market developments, competitor activity, and customer insights to refine territory strategies and maximise growth opportunities.

Collaborate closely with Clinical, Marketing, and Service teams to deliver an outstanding customer experience.

What We Expect:

Proven sales success within medical devices, healthcare, or a related industry.

Experience within a surgical environment; exposure to gynecology is highly advantageous.

Strong understanding of hospital structures, purchasing pathways, and healthcare decision-making processes.

Excellent communication and presentation skills, with the ability to engage both clinical and commercial stakeholders.

A proactive, entrepreneurial mindset with strong territory planning and business development capabilities.

Strong analytical, negotiation, and problem-solving skills.

Proficiency with Microsoft Office; experience using CRM systems such as Salesforce is desirable.

Fluent German and strong English language skills.

Valid driver's licence.

Willingness to travel extensively throughout the territory (approximately 70-80%).

Why Hologic?

Our mission is simple: to enable healthier lives everywhere, every day.

At Hologic, you'll represent market-leading technologies that make a real difference to women's lives. You'll join an international organisation that values innovation, collaboration, and professional development, while giving you the opportunity to make a meaningful impact in healthcare.

We offer:

A highly autonomous territory management role.

Innovative, clinically relevant technologies within a growing market.

Comprehensive onboarding and ongoing professional development opportunities.

A collaborative and high-performing team environment.

Competitive salary, bonus opportunity, company car, and a comprehensive benefits package.

Travel requirements: 70-80% travel, depending on business needs

Language requirements: German and English

Salary: €66,000 – €80,000 gross per annum base + commission (OTE €92,400 – €112,000 based on target performance, with opportunity to earn greater than OTE for those who exceed their targets). The final offer will depend on experience, skills, and alignment with internal pay structures. In addition, we offer a comprehensive benefits package including company car, pension and insurances.

