Conduct specific electrical, optical, and functional tests under the guidance of hardware designers.

Perform asset management and tracking of prototypes and equipment, maintaining accurate records.

Collaborate with the HW development team and other disciplines/sites to ensure seamless prototype delivery and production process improvement.

Maintain and calibrate test stations and instruments, ensuring their proper functioning.

Document test results and provide detailed reports to the hardware designer.

