* You will join our Digitalization Team within the Finance organization of Siemens Healthineers Diagnostic Imaging and work with one of today's most exciting technology fields: Large Language Models (LLMs) and AI Agents
* You will develop an LLM-based Q&A solution for Finance that enables financial controllers to answer complex business questions quickly and efficiently based on financial data. You will have the opportunity to contribute your own ideas and actively shape the solution
* You will design and implement AI agents using Python and LangGraph and work across the entire development pipeline, from data integration and processing to the generation of natural language responses
* You will gain hands-on experience in transforming innovative AI prototypes into robust production-ready solutions within a modern development environment
* You will collaborate closely with financial controllers as future end users, understand real business challenges, and translate them into technical solutions at the intersection of AI, Data, and Finance

